  "label": "Political partisans",
  "description": "The meme is designed for individuals who are politically engaged and aligned with either the Democratic or Republican Party, as it leverages partisan dynamics by contrasting Chuck Schumer's past support for a large border wall funding bill with his current criticism of a smaller, Republican-backed proposal. The exaggerated emotional language ('bitch, cry, piss and moan') and the implication of hypocrisy are intended to resonate with audiences who view political opponents through a partisan lens, particularly those who see Schumer as opportunistic or inconsistent in his stance.",
